the form of the backrest. These legs also feature decorative weaving at their junction points.\n\n**Color Palette:**\nThe color scheme is monochromatic yet richly textured:\n- Deep Navy Blue (or Indigo)\n- Off-White / Cream\n\nThese contrasting tones create strong visual definition against each other within the weave, highlighting the complexity of the craftsmanship.\n\n**Setting and Lighting:**\n*   **Location:** The chair sits on a smooth, light gray floor against a minimalist background wall painted in soft, neutral grays and blues. There’s a distinct corner where different shades meet.\n*   **Lighting:** Bright, directional sunlight streams onto the scene from the left side. This creates sharp, well-defined shadows cast by the chair itself onto both the wall behind it and the floor beside it. The interplay between bright highlights and dark shadow adds depth and dimensionality to the photograph.\n*   **Composition:** The camera angle is slightly elevated, looking down upon the chair, allowing for a clear view of its full profile and architectural details. Its placement near the corner draws attention while providing context through negative space.\n\n**Overall Impression:**\nThe chair exudes a sense of artisanal beauty, combining elements of bohemian chic, mid-century modernism, and tropical elegance. It feels luxurious, unique, and hand"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 44, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 33, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "RECONSTRUCTED_IMAGE", "links": [40], "label": "RECONSTRUCTED_IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "RECONSTRUCTED_IMAGE"}], "size": [324.73828125, 118], "pos": [22601.974609375, 2189.8154296875], "widgets_values": [64], "inputs": [{"name": "tiles", "lin